exports[`ExportReadiness over the sample projects > audits SavedProjects/WaltDelivery-MusicApp-FullLogic.agenticdesign 2`] = `
"NOT A WORKING APP — 2 blocker(s). The screens promise more than the binary can do.

[BLOCKER] 1 flow(s) will NOT be in the exported app
  These flows have no trigger bound to a screen or element, so the exporter drops them — they run in the preview and are absent from the binary: Music Home Welcome. Bind each one's trigger to a button or screen.

[BLOCKER] 3 block(s) have no native implementation
  They do nothing in the exported app: Walt App Interactions → Scroll Restaurants Right, Walt App Interactions → Scroll Categories Right, Walt App Interactions → Scroll Orders Down.

[WARNING] 1 screen(s) show hardcoded data as if it were real
  Walt Delivery - Orders display numbers that are baked into the design and never come from a variable or the backend. An honest empty state beats invented user data.

[WARNING] Project is still called "Untitled Project"
  The bundle identifier and app name are derived from this — set a real product name before shipping."
`;
